  "scope": "The synchronous streamer checks current terrain residency between generated XZ samples. A deferred sample preserves its cursor. Flat and LegacyHash finish before feature stages and their synchronous terrain and fluid writes remain within one physical column. They can continue an already resident column at capacity. Rich modes defer before writing. A call starting below threshold T can cross it by one direct sample footprint W, yielding at most T minus one plus W from that source. The Release control at threshold 50 reaches 113 columns across 32 samples before the fix and reaches 51 after one sample with the fix. The two configured local worker modes each publish exactly one column in the native case.",
  "remaining": "Compose W for feature-capable generation from the supported content and stage write domains. Join cooperative generation, direct edits, record-only owners and the live disk index and registry. The current supplementary World_261 case leaves the full outer-ring, cave, wet, visual and performance matrix open. Full S0-S6 acceptance remains open at 23 of 42 packages.",
